{"translation-revision-date":"2023-02-09 14:09+01:00","generator":"WP-CLI\/2.12.0","source":"js\/congress-a.js","domain":"messages","locale_data":{"messages":{"":{"domain":"messages","lang":"pt_PT","plural-forms":"nplurals=2; plural=(n != 1);"},"Add slot":["Adicionar hor\u00e1rio"],"Add days and time slots. Each slot has time, title, speaker and room.":["Adicione dias e hor\u00e1rios. Cada hor\u00e1rio tem hora, t\u00edtulo, orador e sala."],"Add file":["Adicionar ficheiro"],"Images":["Imagens"],"An event app is the companion page your visitors open with their ticket: programme and schedule, speaker or artist info, venue maps, downloads, media and support pages \u2014 everything structured in one place. Perfect for a congress with multiple sessions, but just as much for a single event where ticket holders need extra info, a FAQ or contact options. Visitors do not need an account or an extra app: their ticket ID is the key, access opens with the ticket and can expire with it. Assign an event app to a product in the WooCommerce product settings \u2014 one app can serve multiple products, so an event series shares one app.":[""],"No icon":[""],"Open inline":["Abrir incorporado"],"Program":["Programa"],"Visitors first see a grid of page cards (icon\/image + description) instead of jumping straight into the first page.":[""],"Manual hard cutoff. Leave empty for unlimited access.":["Limite r\u00edgido manual. Deixe vazio para acesso ilimitado."],"Active":["Ativo"],"Short description (max 160)":[""],"Add section":["Adicionar sec\u00e7\u00e3o"],"Status":["Estado"],"Title and slug are required.":["T\u00edtulo e slug s\u00e3o obrigat\u00f3rios."],"Products":["Produtos"],"Internal":["Interna"],"Current title:":["T\u00edtulo atual:"],"Cancel":["Cancelar"],"Shown in the wallet and email (e.g. \"Opera evening\", \"Zoo visit\"). Empty = use the global default.":[""],"Remove":["Remover"],"Speakers":[""],"Add page":["Adicionar p\u00e1gina"],"Delete section?":["Excluir se\u00e7\u00e3o?"],"Choose video":["Escolher v\u00eddeo"],"Custom width":["Largura personalizada"],"No sections on this page yet.":["Ainda n\u00e3o h\u00e1 sec\u00e7\u00f5es nesta p\u00e1gina."],"Title for new edition (leave empty to auto-generate):":["T\u00edtulo para nova edi\u00e7\u00e3o (deixe vazio para gera\u00e7\u00e3o autom\u00e1tica):"],"Icon, optional image, card color and a short description shown on the page card.":[""],"Rename":["Mudar o nome"],"Choose":["Escolher"],"Add":[""],"Video":["V\u00eddeo"],"Choose which page this section belongs to. Change it to move the section to another page.":["Escolha a que p\u00e1gina pertence esta sec\u00e7\u00e3o. Altere-a para mover a sec\u00e7\u00e3o para outra p\u00e1gina."],"Delete page?":["Eliminar p\u00e1gina?"],"Details":["Detalhes"],"Files":["Ficheiros"],"Drag to reorder pages":["Arraste para reordenar as p\u00e1ginas"],"Page card settings":[""],"Delete":["Eliminar"],"Video URL":["URL do v\u00eddeo"],"Add URL":["Adicionar URL"],"Link (YouTube, Vimeo, \u2026)":["Liga\u00e7\u00e3o (YouTube, Vimeo, \u2026)"],"Display size":["Tamanho de apresenta\u00e7\u00e3o"],"start page":["p\u00e1gina inicial"],"Short bio (max 500 characters)":[""],"Portal label":[""],"Edit section":["Editar sec\u00e7\u00e3o"],"Image":["Imagem"],"Show pages as a card grid on the start screen":[""],"Edit event app":[""],"Icon":[""],"Save congress":["Guardar congresso"],"Assign via the WooCommerce product settings.":["Atribuir pelas configura\u00e7\u00f5es do produto WooCommerce."],"Name":["Nome"],"Unique identifier for this congress. Visitors open it through their personal ticket link, not the slug.":["Identificador \u00fanico deste congresso. Os visitantes acedem-no atrav\u00e9s da liga\u00e7\u00e3o pessoal do seu bilhete, n\u00e3o atrav\u00e9s do slug."],"Type":["Tipo"],"assigned (manage on product level)":["atribu\u00eddo (gerenciar no n\u00edvel do produto)"],"Remove day":["Remover dia"],"Save the congress first to add pages and sections.":["Guarde primeiro o congresso para adicionar p\u00e1ginas e sec\u00e7\u00f5es."],"Select image":["Selecionar imagem"],"Add image":["Adicionar imagem"],"Page":["P\u00e1gina"],"Title":[""],"New edition":["Nova edi\u00e7\u00e3o"],"Image (optional, overrides icon)":[""],"Remove image":[""],"Drag to reorder":["Arraste para reordenar"],"Add speaker":[""],"This action cannot be undone. All sections will be deleted as well.":["Esta a\u00e7\u00e3o n\u00e3o pode ser anulada. Todas as sec\u00e7\u00f5es tamb\u00e9m ser\u00e3o eliminadas."],"Rename page":["Mudar o nome da p\u00e1gina"],"Create":["Criar"],"Current slug:":["Slug atual:"],"Video file":["Ficheiro de v\u00eddeo"],"HTML allowed (same rules as blog posts). JavaScript is stripped.":["HTML permitido (as mesmas regras dos artigos do blogue). O JavaScript \u00e9 removido."],"Open example":[""],"Label for visitors":["Etiqueta para os visitantes"],"OK":["OK"],"Caption (optional)":["Legenda (opcional)"],"Updated:":["Atualizado:"],"Open in browser instead of downloading (PDF, images).":["Abrir no navegador em vez de transferir (PDF, imagens)."],"Pick files from the media library. Label is shown to visitors. Drag to reorder.":["Selecione ficheiros da biblioteca de multim\u00e9dia. A etiqueta \u00e9 apresentada aos visitantes. Arraste para reordenar."],"This action cannot be undone.":["Esta a\u00e7\u00e3o n\u00e3o pode ser anulada."],"Open full size when clicked":["Abrir em tamanho completo ao clicar"],"New event app":[""],"Source":["Origem"],"Speaker":["Palestrante"],"Add day":["Adicionar dia"],"Image URL and optional caption for each item. Drag to reorder.":["URL da imagem e legenda opcional para cada item. Arraste para reordenar."],"Active \u2014 visible to ticket holders":[""],"Remove slot":["Remover hor\u00e1rio"],"Its sections will be moved to the start page. This cannot be undone.":["As suas sec\u00e7\u00f5es ser\u00e3o movidas para a p\u00e1gina inicial. Esta a\u00e7\u00e3o n\u00e3o pode ser anulada."],"Save":["Guardar"],"Pages":["P\u00